  "body": "HS: Matrix.org\r\n\r\nUsing Client : iOS and Android Vanilla Riot\r\n\r\nCreate Room -> Invite a User who is ONLINE. (Not Minimized or Closed). The first user will get this Room Chat in his/her People Tab instead of Room Tab. The second user onwards will get it in Room Tab. \r\n\r\nThis happens both in Android and iOS so I think, this is an API issue in Synapse.",
